note Each row calls setSchedule(type, start, null) at the virtual instant now (zone and locale given; Calendar.getInstance() and the clock read in setSchedule are the probe's), then notifyAndSchedule() three times.
note next0 is getTimeNext() after setSchedule; next1..next3 after each notifyAndSchedule(); started is the start hook count at setup (always 0: one-event scripts never start at load). Times are local ISO-8601 with offset.
note HOURLY start is minute:second. WEEK_OF_MONTH and DAY_OF_WEEK resolve with the locale's first day of week and minimal days in the first week.
